  "id": "baked-sweet-potatoes-with-whipped-feta-and-spiced-chickpeas",
  "name": "Baked Sweet Potatoes with Whipped Feta and Spiced Chickpeas",
  "subtitle": "Tender sweet potatoes with creamy feta, crisp chickpeas, and herb tahini",
  "description": "Bake sweet potatoes until tender, then finish them with whipped feta, spiced chickpeas, and a bright green tahini sauce.",
  "meal_type": "main",
  "yield": {
